# Enemy Bulwark: the SHIELDED line demon of the early nights (from night 1, the Warrior's nights; MatchCoop's sprinkle).
# A grunt-sized body, frail itself (35 health), with a bubble of darkness (about 4.5 m) and a large shield battery: the bubble squishes the players'
# fields back where they meet, and a hit takes the battery first (Game/Enemies "Damage absorb"). An empty battery
# collapses the bubble for good. A little bigger than the Warrior, violet.
Prefab gameEnemyBulwark
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Scene
		Prefab CubeGuy        # the model - see enemyGrunt.pre
			Position 0 0.887 0
			Scale 0.36
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.64
		Density 120
		Friction 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 1.0
		Reach 10
		Centered true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
		ShortName BULWK
		Color 0.5 0.2 0.8
		HealthMax 35
		EnergyMax 150
		ShieldOutput 1.0
		MoveSpeed 3.6
		AttackInterval 1.0
		AttackDamage 7
		PlayerDamage 11
		EmitterDrain 4
